    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "aa76d3e7-6a73-45ad-9d9f-f2ce8efb831d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "e0e52759-05fa-45e9-a6a0-741178880f73",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 3* Best Western Livermead Cliff Hotel, Torquay\u0026#39;s only waterside hotel. The hotel has a restaurant and bar. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "7f9566fb-9c30-4b4b-b8b0-da53608147ac",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMontacute House, Somerset\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExeter Cathedral - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKnightshayes Court\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBuckland Abbey - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERoyal Albert Memorial Museum \u0026amp; Art Gallery - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDartmouth\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDart Estuary cruise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreenway House \u0026amp; Garden\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKillerton - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "7d7db6bf-3da5-4b85-9d47-df71306fc3e1",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowderham Castle - set alongside the Exe Estuary and dating back to 1391, it is home to the 18th Earl of Devon and one of the oldest family houses in England\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EColeton Fishacre - an Arts and Crafts house built in the 1920s in a spectacular coastal setting as the holiday hideaway of the D\u2019Oyly Carte family with an elegant Art Deco influenced interior\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECadhay - a Tudor house, mostly built in the 1540\u2019s, which retains its Great Hall with the later addition of an Elizabethan Long Gallery, and still in private ownership\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBritannia Royal Naval College,Dartmouth - a guided tour of this iconic building explores its considerable history and its role within the Royal Navy today, the training of naval officers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBuckfast Abbey - the great Abbey church, rebuilt on its medieval foundations by the monks themselves, houses many art treasures\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBrunel\u2019s SS Great Britain at Bristol - explore the world\u2019s first great ocean liner including the beautifully recreated First Class Dining Saloon, steerage quarters and new Engine Room\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "dac2f159-27ac-4339-bbee-03ff2d17eb38",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Montacute House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 stop at a convenient property en route such as the National Trust\u2019s Montacute House, a glittering Elizabethan house, adorned with Renaissance features, including contemporary plasterwork and heraldic glass \u2013 continue to the 3* Best Western Livermead Cliff Hotel in Torquay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Exeter Cathedral \u0026amp; Knightshayes Court\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Exeter Cathedral, founded in 1050 and an imposing structure of beauty and antiquity in the heart of the city \u2013 the National Trust\u2019s Knightshayes Court is a Victorian country house with rich interiors, giving an atmospheric insight into grand country life.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Buckland Abbey \u0026amp; Royal Albert Memorial Museum and Art Gallery\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter a scenic drive across Dartmoor, our guided tour of the National Trust\u2019s 700 year old Buckland Abbey explores the rich associations with Elizabethan seafarers Sir Francis Drake and Sir Richard Grenville \u2013 return to Exeter for a guided tour of the newly refurbished Royal Albert Memorial Museum and Art Gallery containing a collection of British artists dating from the 16th to 20th century including Gainsborough and Thomas Patch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Dartmouth, Dart Estuary cruise \u0026amp; Greenway House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETime at leisure in Dartmouth this morning \u2013 cruise from Dartmouth along the Dart Estuary to the National Trust\u2019s Greenway House and Garden which was bought by Agatha Christie in 1938 and boasts an atmosphere of wildness and timelessness and wonderful views of the Dart Estuary \u2013 return to Dartmouth by boat.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Killerton\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the National Trust\u2019s Killerton property, a fine 18th century house containing a fascinating collection of 18th to 20th century costumes \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
